      "evidence": ["src/wrappers/", "README.md:27-46"]
    },
    {
      "name": "共享库导出",
      "description": "导出 libIex、libIlmThread、libOpenEXR、libOpenEXRCore、libOpenEXRUtil 五个 LibraryProduct，供其他 Julia 包通过 ccall 调用 OpenEXR 的 C/C++ API",
      "evidence": ["src/wrappers/x86_64-linux-gnu-cxx11.jl:2-11", "README.md:59-63"]
    },
    {
      "name": "平台适配加载",
